# NoxGuard Demo Video

## Watch the complete product demonstration

📺 YouTube

https://youtu.be/EIbAPeY_22w

---

## Video Overview

This demonstration introduces **NoxGuard**, a developer extension that brings **Confidential Business Lifecycle Management** to existing Solidity smart contracts using **iExec Nox**.

The video covers:

- The problem with public smart contracts
- Why institutions require programmable privacy
- NoxGuard architecture
- Integration with Aave
- Confidential Business Policies
- Confidential Business Lifecycle Management
- Trusted Execution using iExec Nox
- Future vision

Duration: **7 minutes**

